            decide (3 ≤ k0 + (if (colB mp d dw.2).testBit i then 1 else 0)):=by
        simp only [addC,Nat.testBit_or,Nat.testBit_and,h1,h2,h3]
        cases hb : (colB mp d dw.2).testBit i <;>
